<title>USA: Norand launches new hand-held computer.</title>
<headline>Norand launches new hand-held computer.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norand Corp said Monday its new PEN*KEY 6622 hand-held mobile computer is on sale in the United States and Canada and will be available for delivery on March 1.</p>
<p>Norand said the new model, part of the company's PEN*KEY line, is as powerful as a desktop personal computer and weighs 3.1 pounds with an 8.4 inch screen.</p>
<p>The 6622 is designed for use by field sales teams, for example, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
